<lb n="27"/>wir nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">underlassen</unclear> soellen, noch woellen, diß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßers</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürnemens</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>üch, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwe</unclear> lieben eydtgnossen, und insonders <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guote</unclear>
