<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guott</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thrüw</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eydtgnossisch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uffsächen</unclear> zuo unns habenn,
<lb n="32"/>wie wir üch dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dessenn</unclear> gar wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethrüwent</unclear>, und uns
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vergwüßt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hallttent</unclear>, ir darann nit ermanglen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wärdent</unclear>,
<lb n="34"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soellent</unclear> ir üch zuo unns aller schuldiger und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müglicher</unclear>
